cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, the released subsets, or the audit methodology, please cite the
  manuscript (preferred) and TruthfulQA when using TruthfulQA-derived data. Canonical BibTeX
  lives in paper_assets/references.bib; GitHub also reads this file for the “Cite this repository” button.
title: "Audit-Prune: surface-form audit and cleaning for paired-choice truthfulness benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for the manuscript “Judging by the Cover: Auditing Surface-Form Shortcuts in
  Binary-Choice Truth Benchmarks,” including feature-balanced TruthfulQA subsets and audit artifacts.
